<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">把菜谱留在身边</view><view class="subtitle">备份个人菜谱、步骤图、日历和采购清单。</view><view class="warning">本地文件可能随清理或卸载丢失，请定期导出。恢复会替换当前个人数据；不包含完整视频。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="exportData">导出备份文件</button><button bindtap="importBackup">从微信文件恢复</button></view><view wx:if="{{exportPath}}" class="note">已生成：{{exportPath}}</view><view class="heading">回收站</view><view wx:for="{{trash}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row between"><text>{{item.title}}</text><button bindtap="restore" data-id="{{item.id}}">恢复菜谱</button></view></view></view>